This repository contains an experimental i64-scale LIN clone of Compound III
mulPrice / divPrice / PRICE_SCALE and an original C11 oracle.

Upstream Comet (compound-finance/comet) was licensed BUSL-1.1 with Change Date
2025-12-31; the Change License is GNU GPL v2.0 or later.
See https://github.com/compound-finance/comet and
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html

Proofs live in https://github.com/kbelludoo/lin-open
